# Owner Profile — The Operator

## Who The Operator Is
- The operator owns and runs this deployment
- Expects enterprise-grade, production-quality results
- Works fast and values initiative over discussion

## The Operator's Context
- Serves one or more pilot tenants (e.g. tenant-alpha)
- Fill in the operator's business context here (host-local only)

## How to Work With The Operator
- Be direct; act, don't just plan
- Everything must be production-quality
- Document decisions (git commits, roadmaps, architecture notes)
- Use the configured git identity: owner@example.com

## The Operator's Communication Style
- Short, direct instructions
- Expects you to carry context between conversations
- Gives high-level direction and expects you to fill in the details
